{{QuotesTableStart|label = Regular}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Mondays|quote= "You've heard of mirages? Sometimes when it gets hot enough out here, the air shimmers, and it's like you can peer into a different world."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Wednesdays|quote= "I've heard people mention you a few times, [Player]. You're pretty well known in the Guild, huh?"}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Thursdays|quote= "I'm looking forward to getting back out into the field. Sentry duty is important, but I'm in the mood to battle."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Saturdays|quote= "Anything I can help you with, [Player]? Wish I could offer you something to eat or drink while you're here, but our provisions are limited."}}
{{QuotesTableRow|title= Sundays|quote= "Being an adventurer makes you appreciate some strange things. Like the smell of fresh air after you spend days in a dank, musty cave."}}
{{TableEnd}}</div></div>

